&lt;h2&gt;


  2. Apify Internal Breakeven: When to Upgrade Starter → Scale → Business
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Because Apify's prepaid usage equals the plan price, upgrading only saves money once your pay-as-you-go bill on the lower tier exceeds the next tier's monthly floor:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Starter ($19) → Scale ($199):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compute-only: &lt;code&gt;$199 / $0.20 = 995 CUs/mo&lt;/code&gt;. Above &lt;strong&gt;995 CUs&lt;/strong&gt;, Scale's $0.16/CU rate is strictly cheaper than Starter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residential-proxy-only: &lt;code&gt;$199 / $8.00 = 24.88 GB/mo&lt;/code&gt;. Above &lt;strong&gt;24.9 GB&lt;/strong&gt;, Scale's $7.50/GB rate wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Scale ($199) → Business ($999):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compute-only: &lt;code&gt;$999 / $0.16 = 6,243.75 CUs/mo&lt;/code&gt;. Above &lt;strong&gt;6,244 CUs&lt;/strong&gt;, Business ($0.13/CU) wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residential-proxy-only: &lt;code&gt;$999 / $7.50 = 133.2 GB/mo&lt;/code&gt;. Above &lt;strong&gt;133.2 GB&lt;/strong&gt;, Business ($7.00/GB) wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




